    "grace_s": 0.5,
    "amber_mps2": 4.0
   },
   "rule": "TR-5",
   "says": "no NPC vehicle crosses a stop line of j_34 after its light has been red for 0.5 s, and none crosses at amber when it could have stopped braking at 4 m/s^2 or less"
  },
  {
   "id": "green_flow",
